{"id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-abstract-provability-system.md","title":"Abstract Provability System","display":"df-abstract-provability-system — Abstract Provability System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","aliases":["92-df-abstract-provability-system"],"display":"df-abstract-provability-system — Abstract Provability System","source":"第 XI 章 p. 126（PDF 143）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-abstract-provability-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-abstract-provability-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-provability-system — Abstract Provability System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 126（PDF 143）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>：候选五元组；这是集合与运算的元语言结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}\\)</span> 是下文定义的五元组结构谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)\\)</span> 是下文定义的元语言 valuation 谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Taut}_M\\subseteq S\">\\(\\mathrm{Taut}_M\\subseteq S\\)</span> 是下文定义的永真元素集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}provability\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nf\\in S\\land P\\subseteq S\\land(\\Rightarrow):S^2\\to S\\land B:S\\to S,\\\\\n\\neg_MX&amp;\\coloneqq(X\\Rightarrow f),\\qquad\nX\\land_MY\\coloneqq\\neg_M(X\\Rightarrow\\neg_MY),\\\\\nX\\lor_MY&amp;\\coloneqq(\\neg_MX\\Rightarrow Y),\\qquad\nX\\leftrightarrow_MY\\coloneqq(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\land_M(Y\\Rightarrow X),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow V\\subseteq S\\land f\\notin V\\land\n\\forall X,Y\\in S\\;((X\\Rightarrow Y)\\in V\\Longleftrightarrow X\\notin V\\lor Y\\in V),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Taut}_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\in S\\mid\\forall V\\subseteq S\\;\n(\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)\\Longrightarrow X\\in V)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}provability\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nf\\in S\\land P\\subseteq S\\land(\\Rightarrow):S^2\\to S\\land B:S\\to S,\\\\\n\\neg_MX&amp;\\coloneqq(X\\Rightarrow f),\\qquad\nX\\land_MY\\coloneqq\\neg_M(X\\Rightarrow\\neg_MY),\\\\\nX\\lor_MY&amp;\\coloneqq(\\neg_MX\\Rightarrow Y),\\qquad\nX\\leftrightarrow_MY\\coloneqq(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\land_M(Y\\Rightarrow X),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow V\\subseteq S\\land f\\notin V\\land\n\\forall X,Y\\in S\\;((X\\Rightarrow Y)\\in V\\Longleftrightarrow X\\notin V\\lor Y\\in V),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Taut}_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\in S\\mid\\forall V\\subseteq S\\;\n(\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)\\Longrightarrow X\\in V)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>后四行用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span> 成立的结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 表示可证元素，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是“相信/可证”的内部运算。原书的“sentence”在此可以是命题甚至 Boolean 代数元素；不要求是有限字符串或已编码的一阶公式。与公理、规则三元组形式系统是不同的数据类型。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 XI 章 p. 126（PDF 143）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source-extension\">[Source extension]</h2>\n<p>原书另要求 truth set 满足 BX 的真值当且仅当 X 可证，具体定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5214366b706950b4\" href=\"?note=5214366b706950b4\" title=\"92-df-abstract-truth-set\">92-df-abstract-truth-set</a>。valuation 本身只约束 f 和蕴涵，不能代替这一额外条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source-extension","text":"[Source extension]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-truth-set","status":"resolved","id":"5214366b706950b4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source extension]","excerpt":"原书另要求 truth set 满足 BX 的真值当且仅当 X 可证，具体定义见 [[92-df-abstract-truth-set]]。valuation 本身只约束 f 和蕴涵，不能代替这一额外条件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Taut}_M\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}provability\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nf\\in S\\land P\\subseteq S\\land(\\Rightarrow):S^2\\to S\\land B:S\\to S,\\\\\n\\neg_MX&\\coloneqq(X\\Rightarrow f),\\qquad\nX\\land_MY\\coloneqq\\neg_M(X\\Rightarrow\\neg_MY),\\\\\nX\\lor_MY&\\coloneqq(\\neg_MX\\Rightarrow Y),\\qquad\nX\\leftrightarrow_MY\\coloneqq(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\land_M(Y\\Rightarrow X),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)&\\Longleftrightarrow V\\subseteq S\\land f\\notin V\\land\n\\forall X,Y\\in S\\;((X\\Rightarrow Y)\\in V\\Longleftrightarrow X\\notin V\\lor Y\\in V),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Taut}_M&\\coloneqq\\{X\\in S\\mid\\forall V\\subseteq S\\;\n(\\mathrm{Val}_M(V)\\Longrightarrow X\\in V)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":2090,"backlinks":[{"id":"02e8de7bfb004da1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"04668803c3c70a0e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5214366b706950b4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)$，$\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)$；$\\mathrm{Val}_M(T)$ 和 $\\neg_M$ 来自 [[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]。"},{"id":"4339a848b5e63fc1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)$，见 [[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]。"},{"id":"f403c224ddb070f8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Taut}_M$ 来自[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]；$\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}$ 为下文定义的结构谓词，$\\mathrm{consis}_M\\in S$ 为一致性元素。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]] → [[92-df-normal-stable-system]] → [[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]"}],"outgoing":["5214366b706950b4"]}